{
 "id": "BackTo2010C07",
 "slug": "back-to-2010/c07",
 "chapter": "The message",
 "topic": "What if you went back to 2010 with $100?",
 "script": [
  {
   "beat": "c07 p1",
   "text": "That night, you fall asleep. And you wake up in 2026."
  },
  {
   "beat": "c07 p2",
   "text": "Your phone is back. Your room is back. Everything looks normal. You run to the attic, and there's Captain Buttons. Old now. One eye missing. The paper is still inside."
  },
  {
   "beat": "c07 p3",
   "text": "With shaking hands, you type in the password. Eight thousand bitcoins. At bitcoin's peak, that's about a billion dollars."
  },
  {
   "beat": "c07 p4",
   "text": "But there's one transaction you've never seen. Someone sent your wallet a tiny amount of bitcoin. Yesterday. With a message attached. It says: 'We kept a copy too.'"
  },
  {
   "beat": "c07 p5",
   "text": "And downstairs, the doorbell rings."
  },
  {
   "beat": "c07 p6",
   "text": "Is any of this real? The pizzas are. Ten thousand bitcoins, May 2010. The one-cent crash. The eight thousand coins in a Welsh landfill. One in five bitcoins lost forever. All real."
  },
  {
   "beat": "c07 p7",
   "text": "So, would you have taken the fifty thousand dollars? Tell me in the comments. Part two is coming."
  }
 ],
